  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      78.0,
      617.26,
      542.48,
      642.4
    ],
    "text": "(1) by the repeal of sub-regulation (1) of regulation 4 thereof, and the substitution therefor, of the following sub-regulation:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      96.0,
      653.26,
      498.41,
      666.4
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(1). The period to be prescribed for the purposes of Section 22 of the Ordinance shall be fifty years:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
