      98.86,
      550.01,
      136.0
    ],
    "text": "Provided however, the period for a lease of a land for commercial and agricultural activities of investment projects approved by the Board of Investment of Sri Lanka shall be ninety-nine years. The tax for such lease shall be revised in every five years at the rate of twenty per centum.\u201d; and",
